# features.mdc

## Core Features

### 🔐 Authentication & Role Management
- Supabase-based Auth
- Default role: `user`
- Admin can assign `team-lead` or `admin`
- Role-based access to all modules

### 🎬 Video Management
- Add video via YouTube URL
- Auto-fetch title, duration, thumbnail
- Tag & category support
- Admin approval toggle for videos

### 📁 Category System
- Create/edit/delete categories
- Filter & organize video content
- Show category details (description, topic link)
- Enable categories for homepage carousel

### 🎓 Course Management
- Create courses with multiple videos
- Course metadata (title, description, isMandatory, deadline)
- Assign courses to users or teams
- Track course completion rate

### 🧑‍🏫 Assignment & Tracking
- Assign individual videos or entire courses
- Track watch duration and completion per user
- Calculate progress % per course
- 📬 Notify users via in-app and email on each assignment

### 📊 Reporting Dashboard
- Top viewed videos
- Most/least active users
- Course completion by user/team
- Incomplete mandatory courses

### 💬 Comments & Feedback
- User comments per video
- Feedback types: useful / incomplete / incorrect
- Admin/Team Lead can delete inappropriate comments

### 🔔 Notification System
- Notify users about new assignments
- Reminder for uncompleted courses
- Badge icon on navbar
- Email notifications for all important assignment events

### 🧠 Video Recommendations
- Suggest top 5 related videos via YouTube API
- Shown when creating video or category

### 👁️ YouTube Insights
- Pull view count, like count using YouTube API
- Display insights on video detail page

### 🗂️ Category Enhancements
- Set order of categories
- Add helpful links to category
- Manage homepage carousel appearance

### 📝 Transcript System
- Upload or paste video transcripts (.txt or markdown)
- Show in collapsible section below video
- Download transcript file
- 🔄 AI summary & doc generation planned (Phase 2)

---

This document defines the complete set of features tracked in the RFC and implementation plan for the learning module. 